# 🏥 AIIMS Hospital Data Analysis using SQL

## 📌 Project Overview
This project performs in-depth SQL analysis on AIIMS hospital data to extract
business insights related to patients, doctors, departments, billing, and insurance.

The project demonstrates real-world SQL skills required for a Data Analyst role.

---

## 🛠 Tools Used
- SQL (MySQL compatible)
- CSV datasets
- GitHub

---

## 📂 Datasets
- Patients
- Doctors
- Visits
- Billing
- Departments
- Insurance Claims
- States & Districts

---

## 🔍 Key Analysis Performed
- Repeat patient identification
- Doctor-wise patient load
- Department-wise revenue analysis
- Insurance claim trends
- Recent admissions
- High revenue departments

---

## 🧠 SQL Concepts Used
- JOINs (INNER, LEFT)
- GROUP BY & HAVING
- Subqueries
- CTEs (WITH clause)
- Window Functions (RANK)
- Aggregations

---

## ▶ How to Run
1. Create database `aiims`
2. Import CSV files into tables
3. Run `aiims_analysis.sql`

---

## 🎯 Outcome
This project simulates real hospital analytics and is suitable for:
- Data Analyst
- Business Analyst
- SQL Developer roles

